# game/script/script.rpy:389
translate english start_3377b541:

    # mb "本游戏完全免费，任何人不得以任何名义出售本游戏，{color=#ff0000}如果您花钱在他人处购买了本游戏的安装包，请立即找他退款。{/color}"
    mb "This game is completely free of charge. No one is allowed to sell it under any name. If you have purchased the installation package of this game from someone else, please ask for a refund immediately."


# game/script/script.rpy:389
translate english start_7325aead:

    # mb "本游戏为R18游戏，请确保您已满18岁再游玩本作。"
    mb "This game is for adults only (R18). Please ensure you are at least 18 years old before playing this game."

# game/script/script.rpy:389
translate english start_7b1e7057:

    # mb "本游戏的cp为L月，请自行避雷。"
    mb "The coupling/ CP in this game is L-Light. Please be aware of any potential issues."

# game/script/script.rpy:389
translate english start_8356a074:

    # mb "关于二次上传：允许截图游戏内画面进行repo，但是{color=#ff0000}禁止将所有cg图集截图以分享的名义打包上传到QQ群、小红书、LOFTER、微博等平台；{/color}"
    mb "Secondary uploading: taking screenshots of in-game scenes for repo is allowed, but it is strictly prohibited to upload all CG artworks in a package to any platform such as QQ groups, Rednote, LOFTER, and Weibo in the name of sharing."

# game/script/script.rpy:389
