    # mb "所有cg画面均为工作室约稿所得，作为中国大陆工作室，{color=#ff0000}一旦发现必追责，请不要抱有侥幸心理！{/color}"
    mb "All CG artworks are obtained through commissioned works by our studio. As a studio in Chinese Mainland, we will pursue accountability once discovered. Please do not count on luck!"

# game/script/script.rpy:389
translate english start_d50b7ec8_1:

    # mb "所有cg画面均为工作室约稿所得，作为中国大陆工作室，{color=#ff0000}一旦发现必追责，请不要抱有侥幸心理！{/color}"
    mb "All CG artworks are obtained through commissioned works by our studio. As a studio in Chinese Mainland, we will pursue accountability once discovered. Please do not count on luck!"

# game/script/script.rpy:389
translate english start_d50b7ec8_2:

    # mb "所有cg画面均为工作室约稿所得，作为中国大陆工作室，{color=#ff0000}一旦发现必追责，请不要抱有侥幸心理！{/color}"
    mb "All CG artworks are obtained through commissioned works by our studio. As a studio in Chinese Mainland, we will pursue accountability once discovered. Please do not count on luck!"

# game/script/script.rpy:389
translate english start_1199b306:

    # mb "以上，接下来请享受本作吧。"
    mb "Now please enjoy this game."

# game/script/script.rpy:433
translate english start_c2cf5fe8:

    # pb "“到底是怎么回事？为什么不公开Kira的身份？！”"
    pb "'What's going on? Why isn't Kira's identity made public?!'"

# game/script/script.rpy:434
translate english start_fc95f409:

    # pb "“让我们直接和L对话，交涉人！”"
    pb "'Let us talk directly with L, the negotiator!'"

# game/script/script.rpy:435
translate english start_7e1e5630:

    # pb "“你说Kira已经被秘密处刑了，这是怎么回事？”"
    pb "'You said Kira had been executed secretly. We need to know what happened!'"

# game/script/script.rpy:436
translate english start_0ebe624b:

    # pb "会场里在交涉人宣布Kira已经被L秘密处刑之后，掀起了轩然大波。"
    pb "After the negotiator announced that Kira had been executed by L secretly, a great uproar broke out in the venue."

# game/script/script.rpy:437
translate english start_5f84bbb2:

    # pb "各国的警方如同八卦记者一样，恨不得从座位上跳起来扑向渡，把话筒递到渡的嘴边。"
    pb "The police from various countries, akin to gossip reporters, were eager to leap from their seats and pounce on Watari, thrusting the microphone towards his mouth."

# game/script/script.rpy:439
translate english start_9a86a118:

    # D 2 "请肃静，现在就让大家听听L的声音。"
    D 2 "Please be quiet. Now let's listen to L."

# game/script/script.rpy:446
translate english start_2443a78d:

    # pb "话筒一阵刺耳的高音过后，会场恢复了安静，警官们窃窃私语着，猜测交涉人会给出什么回答。"
    pb "After a burst of harsh high-pitched sound from the microphone, the venue returned to silence. The police officers whispered to each other, conjecturing about what response the negotiator would give."

# game/script/script.rpy:454
translate english start_84f2c666:

    # pb "渡打开一台银白色的笔记本电脑，L哥特字母的图案出现在电脑屏幕和会场的大荧幕之上，L独特的电子音也随之响起。"
    pb "Watari opened a silver laptop, and the Gothic letter L appeared on the computer screen and the large screen in the venue at the same time, accompanied by L's unique electronic sound."

# game/script/script.rpy:456
translate english start_af33257d:

    # L laptop "ICPO的各位，我是L。"
    L laptop "ICPO, I am L."

# game/script/script.rpy:458
translate english start_4710b9d9:

    # L laptop "在各位屈服于Kira的杀人能力的时候，是我带领人员秘密调查，找到了真凶。"
    L laptop "When all of you were submitting to Kira's mysterious killing ability, it was I that led the team to conduct a secret investigation and, finally, found who Kira was."

# game/script/script.rpy:458
translate english start_e19e0266:

    # L laptop "当Kira落网之后，各位又开始心思活跃，开始想要利用Kira的杀人能力了吗？"
    L laptop "After Kira was arrested, all of you started to think about utilizing Kira's killing ability for your own interest."

# game/script/script.rpy:458
translate english start_006658f8:

    # L laptop "恕我直言，这简直是卑鄙无耻的行为。"
    L laptop "With all due respect, your intention is literally despicable."

# game/script/script.rpy:458
translate english start_bc6a09b1:

    # L laptop "Kira的杀人能力已经被我封印，真凶落网之后，也不会再有同样的事件发生，我以L的名义保证。"
    L laptop "Kira's ability to commit murder has been sealed by me. I, L, promise that similar incidents will not occur again as the real Kira has been under arrest."

# game/script/script.rpy:458
translate english start_c1cf8adc:

    # L laptop "以上，谢谢聆听。"
    L laptop "That's all, thank you for listening."

# game/script/script.rpy:472
translate english start_e5d69531:

    # pb "语音通话被挂断了，渡干脆利落地合上电脑，在众人反应过来之前从后门离开了。"
    pb "The voice call was disconnected. Watari closed the computer neatly and left through the back door before anyone could give response."

# game/script/script.rpy:479
translate english start_3f330828:

    # pb "被关在身后的，是一片哗然的会场，充斥着对L狂妄言论的声讨，渡对此的反应只是扶正了有些歪斜的礼帽。"
    pb "After his leaving, the venue was filled with an uproar and echoed with condemnations of L's arrogant remarks. Watari's only response was to straighten his slightly tilted hat."

# game/script/script.rpy:480
translate english start_d435dd2f:

    # pb "L本人早已预料到了这种情况，所谓的语音通话只是提前准备好的录音，"
    pb "L had long anticipated this situation, and the so-called voice call was merely a prepared recording."

# game/script/script.rpy:480
translate english start_858ba5ce:

    # pb "他这次来并不是为了解释什么，或者和警方们谈心，只是在通知罢了。"
    pb "His recording was neither for explanation of anything nor communication with the police, just a notice to claim that Kira was dead."

# game/script/script.rpy:483
translate english start_3e085a18:

    # pb "本尊早就将此事抛之脑后，划定为已完成的事项，不再关心。"
    pb "L himself had long put this 'completed task' behind his mind and would not care about it any longer."

# game/script/script.rpy:484
translate english start_4c0875be:

    # pb "因为他现在，有更加关注的事情。"
    pb "Because now there is something attracting him much more."

# game/script/script.rpy:497
translate english start_d930593a:

    # pb "蹲坐在舒服的皮质沙发椅上，海绵和弹簧提供恰到好处的支撑力，宽大的座椅让整个人团在里面也不会觉得狭窄。"
    pb "Sitting comfortably on a plush leather sofa chair, L could curl himself up inside this cozy item without feeling cramped due to the appropriate support given by the sponge and spring."

# game/script/script.rpy:498
translate english start_2dcbbdf1:

    # pb "口味浓郁的香草奶油冰激凌被装在造型精美的镭射玻璃高脚杯里，上面淋了一层巧克力，"
    pb "The richly flavored vanilla cream ice cream, topped with a layer of chocolate, was served in a beautifully designed laser-engraved glass goblet."

# game/script/script.rpy:498
translate english start_bd1cdf0a:

    # pb "上面本应点缀的车厘子已经被吃掉了，一柄银质餐匙斜靠在杯壁上，匙面上还有未吮干净的奶油。"
    pb "The cherry that should have adorned the top of the ice cream had already been eaten. A silver spoon leaned against the goblet with cream still smeared on its surface."

# game/script/script.rpy:502
translate english start_ccac016f:

    # L icecream1 "已经结束了吗？辛苦你了，渡。"
    L icecream1 "Is it over? You've worked hard, Watari."

# game/script/script.rpy:503
translate english start_c34b21ad:

    # D "引起了相当大的骚动呢，不知道之后会持续多久。"
    D "It has caused quite a stir. I wonder how long it will last."

# game/script/script.rpy:504
translate english start_4067c7a1:

    # L icecream1 "既定事实确定之后，公众很快就会把注意力转移到别的事情上的。"
    L icecream1 "Once the  facts are confirmed, the public will quickly shift their attention to other things."

# game/script/script.rpy:505
translate english start_9a1c558b:

    # pb "老人在话筒对面叹了口气，L感受到对方的担忧之情，但只是抿着嘴，固执地不愿意说更多。"
    pb "The old man sighed on the other side of the microphone. L sensed the concern hidden in the sigh, but he just pursed his lips, stubbornly unwilling to say more."

# game/script/script.rpy:506
translate english start_a1658ae8:

    # L icecream1 "渡，快回来吧。"
    L icecream1 "Watari, please come back as soon as possible."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_b70d854b:

    # pb "切断通讯后，L的视线落在屏幕上的一点，失去了焦距，难得发了会呆。"
    pb "After the communication was cut off, L's gaze fell on a point on the screen without focus. Then, L lost in his thought for a  moment rarely."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_a9ce5915:

    # pb "……无论如何，已经做下的事情，不会改变。"
    pb "…What has been done cannot be changed, no matter what."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_26630817:

    # pb "他不是会为打翻的牛奶惋惜的人。"
    pb "He was not the one that would cry over spilt milk."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_1dcafa22:

    # pb "视线重新聚焦，落在了一处监控屏幕上。"
    pb "His gaze refocused on the surveillance screen."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_61da5a3e:

    # pb "那屏幕里铁黑的栏杆排列，明显是一间牢房。"
    pb "Iron black bars could be seen clearly through the screen. In it was a prison cell."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_9e065d19:

    # pb "而在牢房之中，正关押着一名青年。"
    pb "And a young man was being imprisoned inside it. "

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_9ab28dbb:

    # pb "一名有着褐色柔顺头发，年纪不大，身材匀称的青年。"
    pb "A young man, whose hair was brown and smooth and body well-proportioned, was apparently at the age of a college student."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_ad7f425f:

    # pb "他正穿着纯黑的囚服，双手被反铐在身后，双脚也被紧缚，低着头，从监控摄像头里看不清他的表情。"
    pb "He was wearing a pure black prison uniform, with his hands cuffed behind his back and his feet tightly bound. He had his head down, and his expression was not visible through the surveillance camera."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_98f19dfd:

    # pb "如果是不知情的旁人看见，估计会好奇，这青年犯了什么罪，需要被这样严苛地对待？"
    pb "If an uninformed bystander saw this, she/he would probably wonder what crime this young man had committed that deserves such harsh treatment."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_1f36fe00:

    # pb "这时候如果告诉这人，这位就是大名鼎鼎的Kira，估计会被吓一跳吧。"
    pb "If this person was told that the imprisoned young man was the famous Kira, she/he would probably be shocked."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_37fd79ea:

    # pb "完全无法想象，这名看起来年轻优秀的青年会是以一己之力恐吓威慑全世界罪犯的传奇杀人犯。"
    pb "It was completely unimaginable that this seemingly young and outstanding man could be a legendary murderer who had intimidated criminals worldwide by himself only."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_ece993b7:

    # pb "夜神月……L在心里默念着这名青年的名字。"
    pb "Light Yagami... L read the name of this young man in his heart silently."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_d6874b6a:

    # pb "私心亦或是私刑，这的的确确是他做的事情。"
    pb "He did all the things whether it was out of his self-willingness or self-justice."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_1f6389e1:

    # pb "愚弄了全世界，将Kira关在了自己的秘密牢房内。"
    pb "He fooled the whole world and locked Kira in his secret prison."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_3752216c:

    # pb "为了保持夜神月身为Kira的记忆，将死亡笔记的纸片植入了对方的后颈皮肤。"
    pb "A piece of Death Note paper was implanted into this young man's nape in order to preserve his memory as Kira."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_08214152:

    # pb "消去对方的真实身份，无论做了什么都不会被世人发现。"
    pb "Once the social identity of Yagami Light was eliminated, it would never be discovered no matter what they would do in this tiny cell."

# game/script/script.rpy:508
translate english start_1deb0c75:

    # pb "此处，是他所搭建的{color=#0000ff}箱庭世界{/color}。"
    pb "Here was {color=#0000ff} the Hakononaka world {/color} he had built for them two."

# game/script/script.rpy:551
translate english start_849d875f:

    # "曾持有世界上最恐怖的杀人凶器的罪犯被关押在这里，即使世人皆以为他已经死去。"
    "Kira, who once possessed the world's most terrifying murder weapon, was imprisoned here, even though everyone believed he had already died."

# game/script/script.rpy:552
translate english start_9919f1b8:

    # "褐发青年被戴上镣铐，不过他依然表现得相当平静。"
    "The young man with brown hair was shackled, but he remained quite calm."

# game/script/script.rpy:553
translate english start_21bcde4a:

    # sy "今天是监禁的第 [day] 天。"
    sy "Today is Day [day] in jail."

# game/script/script.rpy:554
translate english start_2aaf9f80:

    # sy "现在有 [action_points] 个行动点数。"
    sy "You have [action_points] action points."

# game/script/script.rpy:555
translate english start_c8cd1c06:

    # sy "接下来可以行动了。"
    sy "You can take action now."

# game/script/script.rpy:557
translate english start_d5ad15ef:

    # sy "需要查看新手教程吗？" nointeract
    sy "Do you need to view the beginner tutorial?" nointeract

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_d1d49785:

    # sy "本游戏为试玩版，在本游戏中，你可以用L的视角在7天内对监禁中的夜神月采取任意行动。"
    sy "This game is a trial version. In this game, you can take any action towards the imprisoned Light from the perspective of L within 7 days."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_4d5aa011:

    # sy "每天有4个行动点数，行动点数耗尽后进入下一天。"
    sy "There are 4 action points per day, and the next day will start once no action point is left."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_6e996751:

    # sy "注意，做爱会消耗2点行动点数。"
    sy "Notice: Making Love will consume 2 action points."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_e0de52f1:

    # sy "采取不同的行动，夜神月的状态也会发生改变。温柔地对待亦或是冷酷地折磨？由你来决定。"
    sy "The state of Light will change according to the actions you take. How to treat him? Gently or cruelly? It's all up to you."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_f5202f7e:

    # sy "右上角显示的是夜神月的简易状态值，点击行动菜单里【月的状态】可以查看详细的数值。"
    sy "You can view the simplified status value of Light at the upper right corner and the detailed status value of Light in the Light's Status in the action menu."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_6b02d9f7:

    # sy "月好感度的高低有时候会影响剧情的发展，同时是影响结局走向的重要数值。"
    sy "Light's affection can sometimes affect the development of the plot and is also an important numerical value that influences the direction of the ending."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_49a5f8b2:

    # sy "在demo（试玩版）中，月的好感度最高只能升到70，更高的上限在游戏的正式版中开放。"
    sy "In the demo (trial version), the maximum Light's Affection is 70. A higher upper limit will be available in the official version of this game."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_f2746b92:

    # sy "请时刻注意月的饱食度、清洁度、压力值，如果数值太低会降低月的健康值。"
    sy "Please pay attention to Light's Satiety, Cleaness, and Stress all the time, as low values may decrease Light's Health."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_20ef540f:

    # sy "如果健康值归零，游戏会结束，进入试玩版的bad end。"
    sy "If the Health reaches 0, the game will end and enter the bad ending of this trial version."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_9e75861a:

    # sy "粉红行动会消耗月的体力值，月每天会根据身体情况恢复一定的体力值。如果月的身体状态好，会恢复更多的体力值。"
    sy "The Making love option will consume Light's Energy, and a certain amount of energy will recover every day based on Light's physical condition. If Light's physical condition is good, he will recover more energy."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_1a9299ad:

    # sy "涩涩虽好，但是需要节制哦~"
    sy "Although Making love is seductive, Light also needs some rest."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_28b6a20c:

    # sy "试玩版的7天结束后没有结局，所以请尽情地存档与读档吧！"
    sy "There isn't a formal ending after 7 days in the trial version, so feel free to save and load as much as you like!"

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_e21f27c1:

    # sy "可以在标题画面的【画廊】查看已经收集到的CG。"
    sy "You can view the CGs you have collected in the 'Gallery' in the title sector."

# game/script/script.rpy:559
translate english start_aaa4a575:

    # sy "以上，祝您游玩愉快~"
    sy "That's all. Wish you a pleasant time."

# game/script/script.rpy:592
translate english start_70c268a3:

    # sy "祝您游玩愉快~"
    sy "Wish you a pleasant time."

# game/script/script.rpy:680
translate english next_day_f7f106c0:

    # sy "一天结束了……"
    sy "The day is over."

# game/script/script.rpy:691
translate english next_day_2156ccd4:

    # sy "今天是第 [day] 天。"
    sy "Today is Day [day] in jail."

# game/script/script.rpy:691
translate english next_day_5674c1eb:

    # sy "你恢复了 [action_points] 点行动点数。"
    sy "You have recovered [action_points] action points."

# game/script/script.rpy:691
translate english next_day_ec746afb:

    # sy "饱食度自然下降，当前饱食度: [satiety]/100"
    sy "Satiety decreases naturally. Current satiety value: [satiety]/100."

# game/script/script.rpy:691
translate english next_day_bfd90bb8:

    # sy "清洁度自然下降，当前清洁度: [clean]/100"
    sy "The Cleaness decreases naturally. Current clean value: [clean]/100."

# game/script/script.rpy:706
translate english next_day_412c1747:

    # "月看起来已经挨饿了有一段时间了，他的脸颊消瘦下去，整个人显得无精打采。"
    "Light looks hungry for several hours. His cheeks have thinned out, and he appears listless."

# game/script/script.rpy:706
translate english next_day_6ecf1ee6:

    # "也许该给他喂食了，否则可能会生病。"
    "Perhaps it's time to feed him, otherwise he might get sick."

# game/script/script.rpy:713
translate english next_day_63b6b711:

    # sy "由于月极度饥饿，健康值下降30点"
    sy "Due to extreme hunger, Ligh's Health decreases by 30 points."

