# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_cdd137e1:

    # pb "面对昔日的仇敌，平分秋色的对手，L看着现在被关押在囚室中任人宰割的青年，突然感到兴意阑珊。"
    pb "Confronting his former nemesis and longtime rival, L observed the young man now imprisoned and utterly helpless within the cell and felt a sudden loss of interest."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_cab43fa3:

    # pb "他对待夜神月就像对待无数个被抛弃的玩具一样，在最初的新奇感褪去之后，将对方扔至杂物箱中。"
    pb "He treated Light Yagami just like countless discarded toys—once the initial novelty faded, he cast him aside into storage. "

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_294bd739:

    # pb "就像被遗忘的电子宠物一般，关上监控屏幕，也就切断了联系，等到再想起时，只余一具冰冷腐烂的尸体。"
    pb "Much like a forgotten digital pet, switching off the monitor severed all connection. By the time he remembered, nothing remained but a cold and decaying body."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_4d343a8d:

    # pb "只是电子宠物在游戏厂商的设计下还可以复活，但是现实世界的人类不行。"
    pb "But unlike digital pets, which game developers can always revive, humans in the real world do not return."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_760d26aa:

    # pb "L突然有些烦躁。"
    pb "L grew somewhat uneasy."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_2be31949:

    # pb "他没有养过宠物，对养成类的游戏也不感兴趣，脑海中的确有养宠物的基础知识：喂食、清洁、适当的娱乐……"
    pb "He had never kept a pet, nor had he ever been interested in raising simulations. He knew the basics, of course—feeding, cleaning, providing stimulation—"

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_774efde2:

    # pb "但是当理论变为现实，陌生的负面情绪依然让他无所适从。"
    pb "but when theory became reality, these unfamiliar emotions left him deeply unsettled."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_92a084fe:

    # pb "渡知道夜神月的存在，也多次欲言又止地看着他，只不过一切都是他的游戏，他的决策，所以没有插手。"
    pb "Watari was aware of Light's presence and had often looked at L as though he wanted to speak yet always held back. This was L's game, his decision, and so Watari never intervened."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_195dad64:

    # pb "L不愿意去想象夜神月死前经受着怎样的折磨，可能已经饿得烧心，灌饮自来水来抵抗饥饿感，啃食能入口和不能入口的，甚至是自己的血肉；"
    pb "L avoided imagining what suffering Light might have endured before death: the gnawing hunger, the frantic gulps of tap water, the desperate chewing on anything within reach—edible or not, even his own flesh; "

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_c185957b:

    # pb "可能由于压力过大产生了自杀倾向，暴力地挣扎手铐直到骨折，或是用头一遍又一遍地撞击墙壁，直到鲜血淋漓；"
    pb "Perhaps suicidal despair  had occurred under overwhelming pressure, struggling violently until bones broke, or beating his head against the wall until blood flowed; "

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_19bb9811:

    # pb "可能某天突然发起高烧，免疫系统崩溃，高热杀死了病菌也杀死了生命本身，青年在病痛的折磨下陷入沉眠，意识归于黑暗……"
    pb "Maybe with a sudden high fever, his immune system collapsed, the scorching heat killing both infection and life alike—sinking into a final unconsciousness, his mind swallowed by darkness…"

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_a68a76ec:

    # pb "也可能，这些夜神月都经历过。"
    pb "It was possible Light had experienced all of it."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_6b00c8d2:

    # pb "L有些不愿意面对月的尸体，他只是出于恶趣味或者刻意的忽略弄坏了一个玩具，但是并不想背负上一些沉重的东西。"
    pb "L didn't want to see the body. He had just broken a toy out of carelessness or whimsy—not meaning to carry the weight of a real death."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_6de69a48:

    # pb "但是渡平静地看着L的眼睛，跟他说，我现在要去收敛夜神月的尸体，L，你跟我来。"
    pb "Yet Watari looked calmly into L's eyes and said, 'I will retrieve Light Yagami's body now. L, come with me.'"

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_56bfbf1a:

    # pb "L没有拒绝，也没有说话，只是默默地跟随在渡的后面。"
    pb "L didn't refuse. He didn't speak. He simply followed in silence."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_da535ffa:

    # pb "自从他成为“L”之后，一直是渡跟在他的后面，这次的路程让L感到陌生、漫长、甚至有些畏惧。"
    pb "Ever since he had become 'L', it was always Watari who followed him. This time, the path made L unfamiliar, endless—almost frightening."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_4470ccb1:

    # pb "他不是没有接触过尸体，但是那些尸体的因果并不在他身上，他只是侦探，作为旁观者堪清真相。"
    pb "He had encountered bodies before, but those deaths weren't on his hands. He was only a detective—an observer who uncovered truth."

# game/script/script.rpy:901
translate english bad_end_26091baa:

    # pb "电梯把他们送入地下，这条路L走过很多次，只是第一次怀着这样的心情，连脚步声都变得沉重刺耳，回荡在空旷的地下。"
    pb "The elevator descended underground. L had walked this path many times, but never with such a heavy heart. Even his footsteps sounded harsh and amplified in the hollow silence."

# game/script/script.rpy:939
translate english bad_end_5a7651f8:

    # "还没到囚室，L已经闻到尸胺独有的臭味，他又想逃避了，只是按捺住这种冲动，强迫自己冷静下来。"
    "Before they reached the room, the distinctive odor of cadaverine reached him. He wanted to turn back—to escape—but forced himself to remain calm."

# game/script/script.rpy:939
translate english bad_end_baa12b6e:

    # "走到囚室门口，渡掏出钥匙打开了格栅门，金属门发出吱呀的声音，露出夜神月倒在地上的身影。"
    "At the cell door, Watari unlocked the grate. The metal door creaked open, revealing Light's body collapsed on the floor."

# game/script/script.rpy:939
translate english bad_end_9be0f2e1:

    # "L匆匆扫了两眼，已经没办法把这具开始肿胀腐烂的尸体和记忆中的夜神月联系到一起，无论是颜色、气味、还是那双充满恶意的浑浊眼珠。"
    "L stole a glance quickly. He could no longer connect this swollen, rotting form to that Light Yagami he once knew—he’s not that color, not that smell, not those clouded eyes filled with eternal malice."

# game/script/script.rpy:939
translate english bad_end_0207c932:

    # "已是死不瞑目。"
    "He had died with eyes open."

# game/script/script.rpy:939
translate english bad_end_6ffa3a90:

    # "尸体被装进收尸袋中，然后放上推车，最后会由专门的车辆运送到墓园，下葬立碑。"
    "The body was bagged, placed on a gurney, and would soon be transported by a specialized vehicle to the cemetery for burial. A tombstone would be erected."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_d9fd2a26:

    # "L全程没说几句话，虽然他平时在和警方交流之外也不是话多的性子，但是渡能感觉到L的低气压。"
    "L spoke little throughout. Though never talkative except the police, Watari could feel the grim atmosphere surrounding him."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_17be5782:

    # "在这种时候，渡觉得L还很孩子气。"
    "In moments like these, Watari thought L was still quite naive."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_023a0d8d:

    # "面对由自己导致的死亡，会感到茫然、逃避、愧疚、抑郁，这些都是初次经历者正常的情感反应。"
    "Feeling lost, guilty, and reluctant to face a death he caused—these were all natural for someone experiencing it for the first time."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_6f7160ba:

    # "在这方面，渡也不希望L会有更多的经验。"
    "Watari hoped L would never have to learn too much in this regard."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_30b35fbc:

    # "L需要学习对生命和死亡保持敬畏。"
    "What L needed was to learn respect for life and death."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_11010288:

    # "葬礼的仪式从简，牧师在墓前诵念《圣经》："
    "The funeral was brief. A priest stood in front of the grave and recited the Bible:"

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_6122acf3:

    # "The Lord is my shepherd, I lack nothing. （耶和华是我的牧者，我必一无所缺。）"
    "The Lord is my shepherd, I lack nothing."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_e247f374:

    # "He makes me lie down in green pastures, he leads me beside quiet waters, he refreshes my soul. （他让我躺卧在青草地上，领我到幽静的溪水旁。）"
    "He makes me lie down in green pastures, he leads me beside quiet waters, he refreshes my soul."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_574a5098:

    # "He guides me along the right paths for his name's sake. （他使我的心灵苏醒，为了自己的名引导我走正路。）"
    "He guides me along the right paths for his name's sake."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_90a824ea:

    # "Even though I walk through the darkest valley, I will fear no evil, for you are with me…（我纵使走过死亡的幽谷，也不怕遭害，因为你与我同在……）"
    "Even though I walk through the darkest valley, I will fear no evil, for you are with me…"

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_7396a5f9:

    # "葬礼当天的天气很凉爽，天色发白，看不见太阳，亦没有浓重的乌云。"
    "The day was cool under a pale sky—devoid of sun, yet free of heavy clouds."

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_bac4ac7d:

    # "L听着牧师的诵念声发呆，他的目光停留在新做的墓碑上，上面写着："
    "L listened absently to the priest's words, with eyes resting on the newly placed tombstone. It read:"

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_6dd90eac:

    # "【The only puzzle I couldn't solve.】（终局无解）\n 【Light】\n 【1986-2004】"
    "{i}The only puzzle I couldn't solve.{/i}\n Light\n 1986-2004"

# game/script/script.rpy:953
translate english bad_end_680ca885:

    # "【Game Over. No Rematch.】（对局终止 再无重赛）"
    "{i}Game Over. No Rematch.{/i}"


